Nacho: Hey Albeni, you ever wonder why we’re even here?
Albeni: Huh? What do you mean, Nacho?
Nacho: Like, what’s the point of all this? Just sittin’ around, doin’ nothin’.
Albeni: I guess I never really thought about it that way.
Nacho: Yeah, it’s kinda crazy when you think about it.
===
